  - statementId: 2
    basicConversation:
    - id: 0
      conversation: I used to be a gold digger before I came to this place. As I have worked many years, I figured out how to make the money. Many people would look whats in front of them to make money. And it will lead you to someplace where you can no longer avoid. Riches say one needs to be prepared to make money. Must learn how to look further before..
